      <profileDesc>
         <abstract><p>Though this malkǝʾ, transmitted in <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ANLcr23 "><seg corresp="ANLcr23 ">No item: ANLcr23</seg></ref>, is described by   <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/N6HPGQK3"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue"/><title level="m">Catalogue des manuscrits éthiopiens de l’Accademia Nazionale dei Lincei: Fonds Conti Rossini et Fonds Caetani 209, 375, 376, 377, 378</title><title level="s">Indici e Sussidi Bibliografici della Biblioteca</title><author><forename>Stefan</forename><surname>Strelcyn</surname></author><pubPlace>Roma</pubPlace><publisher>Accademia Nazionale dei Lincei</publisher><date>1976</date><series><title level="s">Indici e Sussidi Bibliografici della Biblioteca</title><biblScope unit="volume">9</biblScope></series><biblScope unit="volume">9</biblScope><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:IHABook182</note><note type="tag">bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue</note></note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:IHABook182</note><note type="tag">bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue</note><citedRange unit="page">82</citedRange></bibl> as
            being for <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS1640Alaniqos">ʾAlāniqos</persName>, it seems more likely that it is actually
            for his student Taṭamqa Madḫǝn, see <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/BWJEWURQ"><seg type="journalArticle"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Marrassini1982Alaniqos"/><title level="a">Il &lt;hi rend="italics"&gt;Gadla Alāniqos&lt;/hi&gt;</title><title level="j">Egitto e Vicino Oriente</title><author><forename>Paolo</forename><surname>Marrassini</surname></author><date>1982</date><biblScope unit="volume">5</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">143-182</biblScope><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Hagiography, Ethiopian</note><note type="tag">bm:Marrassini1982Alaniqos</note></note><note type="tag">Hagiography, Ethiopian</note><note type="tag">bm:Marrassini1982Alaniqos</note><citedRange unit="page">146</citedRange></bibl>. </p></abstract>
